	"Description": "[size=5][b][i]Stardew Parade\u00A0— A Stardew Valley Collection[/i][/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/games/stardewvalley/collections/oq13tr]Collection Page[/url]\u00A0– [url=https://discord.gg/pJ5wexKUx3]Discord Community[/url]\n<br />\n<br />Hello, random mod user! [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/games/stardewvalley/collections/oq13tr]Stardew Parade[/url] is a Collection I've spent the last several months curating and writing content for it. If you're only on this website to download mods for an already existing modlist, Collections might not be your thing, but I'd be thankful if you took a look anyway. Follow the link above or [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/games/stardewvalley/collections/oq13tr]click here[/url] to check it out.\n<br />\n<br />You can install Collections on [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10455]Stardrop[/url] as well! Update to the latest version.\n<br />\n<br />This page hosts the small patches I've put made to ensure this Collection is running without issues. Most of my bug fixes have already been submitted upstream to mod authors so everyone can use them, but you're welcome to take these as well. I've also included the configuration files as well.\n<br />\n<br />[b]Donation Points are disabled on this page.[/b]",
